---
// Engraved instrument-scale rule: a gold line with minor and major ticks.
---
<svg class="tick-rule" aria-hidden="true">
  <line x1="0" y1="0.5" x2="100%" y2="0.5" stroke="#D8B25C" stroke-width="1" />
  <rect width="100%" height="12" fill="url(#go-tick)" />
  <rect width="100%" height="12" fill="url(#go-tick-major)" />
</svg>
